[{"title":"题天衣寺","author":"袁说友","text":"稽山道上多名迹，万顷湖光衬山色。\n云蒸雾集累千年，屈指风流几人物。\n平生佳处身曾经，赖此泉石供馀龄。\n爱山何惜买山费，明珠不博娉与婷。\n我闻天衣最奇绝，万顷清凉扫烦热。\n持经夜半鸟鼠听，忽睹金仙起还灭。\n把茅从此成开山，法华妙果僧中贤。\n当时十诏徵不起，神奇变化泥生莲。\n山神谨护泥封诏，独有遗风传内教。\n袈裟金缕照琉璃，时放祥光蔽云物。\n我来官守无时閒，著脚未历城南山。\n区区俗眼空自翳，耿耿此意如循环。\n我心岂是真如石，惭愧新诗与推激。\n自怜未到此山中，想见入山深未得。\n要令攻俗如攻城，兹游约与秋风迎。\n吾曹岂办痴儿事，为君一醉南湖清。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60197,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题王顺伯秘书所藏兰亭修禊帖","author":"袁说友","text":"永和九年暮春日，兰亭修禊群贤集。\n含毫欲下意已先，媚日暄风佐摇笔。\n当时一笔三百字，但说斯文感今昔。\n谁知已作尤物看，流传人间天上得。\n天高地远閟不示，仅许一二翻摹勒。\n忽然飞上白云俱，径入昭陵陪玉骨。\n识真之士已绝少，真者一去嗟难觅。\n纷纷好事眼空眩，只把残碑慕真迹。\n萧郎袖去明真赝，定武传来差甲乙。\n如丁如爪辨形似，不丰不露分肥瘠。\n人亡无复见风流，漫费精神疲得失。\n临川先生天下士，古貌古心成古癖。\n搜奇日富老不厌，如渴欲饮饥欲食。\n有时瞥眼道傍见，倒屣迎之如不及。\n牙签轴已过三万，集古录多千卷帙。\n平生著意右军处，并蓄兼收一何力。\n赏音本在笔墨外，何必此优而彼劣。\n清波万顷浑一点，明月一轮云半入。\n是中元不碍真趣，气象典刑尤历历。\n知我罪我春秋乎，政尔未容言语直。\n我方随群厚其嗜，门户弗彊才仅立。\n几年冥搜政无那，剩欲流涎分半席。\n阅公善本三四五，不觉长歌书卷侧。\n羲之死矣空费公家九万笺，安得斯人写金石。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60198,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题杨诚斋南海集二首 其二","author":"袁说友","text":"诗以变成雅，骚以变达意。\n变其权者徒，中有至当义。\n水清石自见，变定道乃契。\n文章岂无底，过此恐少味。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60199,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题杨诚斋南海集二首 其一","author":"袁说友","text":"君侯大雅姿，万态归物色。\n商略南海句，以心不以迹。\n试吐胸中奇，如臂指运力。\n今推王扬贤，童子漫雕刻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60200,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题陈日华二友堂","author":"袁说友","text":"书生作吏从朱墨，官事纷纷何日息。\n不堪雁鹜对敲朴，宁解诗书伴松竹。\n太丘退食何萧然，笔研不落尘埃边。\n前岁读书山水县，今年二友来通川。\n料君捧诏还朝日，老盖寒梢应的皪。\n此时留与后人看，要使清风继前迹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60201,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题陈氏净香亭","author":"袁说友","text":"人生乐事难，清节视险夷。\n遇坎而履坦，讵以得丧亏。\n我观万物间，独此琅玕宜。\n颀然挺冰操，得之风雨时。\n秋风桐飞翻，夏雨民怨咨。\n怵迫真乃见，嗟物如一岐。\n此君岂其然，风雨而不移。\n娟娟净明月，细细香浮漪。\n此理固千载，俗士难与知。\n洮湖著危亭，千亩胸中奇。\n植此凛凛节，照公堂堂姿。\n仕已轻浮云，喜愠不一施。\n山高空翠湿，草劲便疾吹。\n此风此雨至，公乎无磷缁。\n我方索米久，官事成痴儿。\n望公潇洒中，粪壤与菌芝。\n何当亭上游，细诵简斋诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60202,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题墨梅","author":"袁说友","text":"轻梅拂拂有馀清，笔下翻成月下横。\n昨夜小屏幽梦断，恍如烟雨瘴江城。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60203,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠王副伴","author":"袁说友","text":"将军年少时，束发在行伍。\n西方顷多事，二十勇如虎。\n一身殆百战，手足疮四五。\n征行久边戍，肯惮服役苦。\n西陲五十郡，一一经险阻。\n一官三十年，铢积仅如许。\n我闻中兴后，卷甲久未举。\n宿将零落尽，屈指不可数。\n政恐据鞍者，骄懦如婴乳。\n时平偶无事，酒肉而子女。\n问之行阵事，缩头而栗股。\n有如将军乎，少小服军旅。\n金疮历历在，末老勇亦贾。\n抵掌谈世事，忠愤气如鼓。\n愿欲奏君王，臣不知死所。\n轻舟明月夜，慷慨闻奏语。\n酾酒誓长淮，有力期共努。\n归去觐前旒，此怀须尽吐。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60204,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠青眼杨相士","author":"袁说友","text":"秋风摵摵敲庭槚，独卧孤窗类瘖哑。\n道人剥啄向东塘，欲识酸寒孟东野。\n公今以直不以情，我亦论心不论形。\n平生方寸只如此，政可烦公双眼青。\n年来万事翻成覆，幸有藏家书可读。\n丁宁莫学世间痴，苦欲从公专问福。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60205,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"十三日饮俞园昌甫斯远彦章毕至","author":"袁说友","text":"忽尔严冬设鲙，更于晴日观梅。\n人道荒寻邂逅，我忻良集而来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60206,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和程泰之阁学汎舟南溪遇雪韵三首 其三","author":"袁说友","text":"孤雁声悲南浦，渔人冷彻归蓑。\n独有耐寒琼玉，一枝先夺阳和。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60207,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和程泰之阁学汎舟南溪遇雪韵三首 其二","author":"袁说友","text":"怜我闭门卧雪，惭渠有酒盈樽。\n老尽青山晓色，愁添白发霜根。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60208,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和程泰之阁学汎舟南溪遇雪韵三首 其一","author":"袁说友","text":"目断山前浮玉，春回雪里宜城。\n得意扁舟乘兴，归来好语增明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60209,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题东坡苏公三笑图帖","author":"袁说友","text":"不觉虎溪过却，轩渠一笑而归。\n此笑此心真处，自然鱼跃鸢飞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60210,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题米元晖太湖图卷","author":"袁说友","text":"水际天低岸远，山腰雾捲云铺。\n拟唤松江小艇，归来好趁莼鲈。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60211,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"袁说友","text":"水暗人家水拍堤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60212,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"浮云宫","author":"袁陟","text":"为余传语岭头云，君自无心笑我勤。\n我亦暂来称使者，眼看官职似看君。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60213,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题刘仁瞻画像","author":"袁陟","text":"阵前仙琕生无愧，鼓下蛮奴死合羞。\n三尺吴缣暗尘土，凛然苍鹘欲横秋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60214,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠郭功甫二绝 其一","author":"袁陟","text":"从来多病王僧祐，自小能文谢惠连。\n各厌尘劳思物外，莫辞携手访林泉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60215,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠郭功甫二绝 其二","author":"袁陟","text":"雪后姑溪水更深，冥冥寒雨作连阴。\n旅怀未可顿消遣，思与洛生溪上吟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60216,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"临终作","author":"袁陟","text":"青霭千峰暝，悲风万古呼。\n其谁挂宝剑，应有奠生刍。\n皎月东方陨，长松半壑枯。\n山泉吾所爱，声到夜台无。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60217,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠功甫","author":"袁陟","text":"方山忆共汎金船，屈指于今五六年。\n风送梨花吹醉面，月和溪水上归鞯。\n浮生聚散应难料，末路穷通尽偶然。\n欲问故人牢落事，鹿裘深入白云眠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60218,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"百丈山","author":"袁陟","text":"复岭踰崷崒，层崖遍屈盘。\n寺当幽谷面，路指白云端。\n树老苍天骨，蓝凝上帝冠。\n石屏秋已冻，板屋夜多寒。\n三宿孤怀恋，千山远梦残。\n惟愁钟动晓，西下见征鞍。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60219,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过金陵谒吴大帝庙","author":"袁陟","text":"人苦曹瞒虐，天悲汉禄终。\n山河分鼎峙，气象发江东。\n一旦墟京洛，弥年豢幼冲。\n炎精竟灰烬，紫盖出艨艟。\n长策资公瑾，雄才得吕蒙。\n招延师友义，继述父兄忠。\n旧府峨双阙，惊涛涌半空。\n风云龙虎势，日月帝王功。\n地力因时险，神谋与意通。\n屈伸思所济，逆顺审于衷。\n骏足嗤交货，灵牙耀即戎。\n同盟界函谷，独断保蚕丛。\n定霸葵丘劣，推心建武同。\n长沙兆生谶，典午赖馀风。\n战守遗踪在，登临四望中。\n陵迁成万古，世异想群雄。\n歌舞居民祀，干戈逐虏功。\n征帆来浦外，久客怆途穷。\n精锐销孤剑，飘零若断蓬。\n徘徊灵庑下，暮叶乱江枫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60220,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再游云居","author":"袁陟","text":"风吹岭头树，似欲招行客。\n缘云过绝顶，复见紫霄宅。\n平观三百里，下视八千尺。\n隼击九秋严，鹏展万里翮。\n五老镇相望，西岫天与敌。\n可笑培塿群，亦自矜寸碧。\n氛埃卷宇宙，雁鹜下川泽。\n既谐慧智心，若蹈圣贤域。\n危亭据中峰，回抱竦天壁。\n沈沈古帝坐，左右列夔稷。\n举头河汉通，直欲攀南极。\n合奏天地籁，两耳清历历。\n吁嗟万类微，胡为竞朝夕。\n安知太清上，我方适所适。\n尚思西巘路，去冬蹑双屐。\n高兴挹洪厓，大句鼓天力。\n到今岩壑间，浩浩起金石。\n安得少陵翁，物外讲新格。\n重来羁绁在，欲隐世累迫。\n多谢受命松，长存岁寒色。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60221,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"奉和","author":"袁陟","text":"客意正索寞，诗筒江际来。\n一闻清玉韵，如见翠屏开。\n磅礴云霄外，腾凌鸾凤回。\n仙源朝露蔽，乳窦夜风豗。\n九月已冰霰，三时无沴灾。\n徒均南亩泽，应老邓林材。\n岌岌耸天柱，岩岩尊国台。\n高名皆祸尔，真赏岂然哉。\n紫盖攲松蔓，青钱点石苔。\n神虬潜夭矫，皓鹤舞毰毸。\n采药蕃芝朮，寻花有杏梅。\n丹台今窅窅，苍壁古嵬嵬。\n绝顶飞泉落，平崖枯柏摧。\n势堪卑蒋霍，名不假刘雷。\n释子安生计，幽人足隐媒。\n云中认幡刹，汉上醉觥罍。\n荜户方穷阨，篮轩阻奉陪。\n耳愁尘事入，心怯岁华催。\n已作五噫咏，元非三杰才。\n先将丘壑意，模写寄春台。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60222,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宿简寂观","author":"袁陟","text":"名山崇秘祠，终夜得清赏。\n真气溢空浮，流泉随砌响。\n林峦片月散，殿阁高风行。\n天际斗杓直，庭中盘石横。\n逸人今何之，故岭不改秀。\n白鹤唳松梢，青灯覢岩窦。\n恍追汗漫驾，深悟逍遥言。\n四顾群动寂，冥心归灏元。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60223,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"袁陟","text":"琼田收?稏，玉溜注琅玕。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60224,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"象耳山","author":"袁倚","text":"昔闻神龙蟠九渊，今睹大象扶诸天。\n何年幻此一佛国，两耳不动山苍然。\n上乘菩萨踞其上，妙千手眼化大千。\n众生颠倒梦始觉，热病得汗诸魔跧。\n两客游山饮崖泉，拍手唤醒书台仙。\n一邱一壑傥如愿，同竟大悲香火缘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60225,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"袁倚","text":"江头晓夜日月出，九顶三峨相吐吞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60226,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"传言玉女","author":"袁绹","text":"眉黛轻分，惯学玉真梳掠。\n艳容可画，那精神怎貌。\n鲛绡映玉，钿带双穿缨络。\n歌音清丽，舞腰柔弱。\n宴罢瑶池，御风跨皓鹤。\n凤凰台上，有萧郎共约。\n一面笑开，向月斜褰珠箔。\n东园无限，好花羞落。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60227,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"撒金钱","author":"袁绹","text":"频瞻礼。\n喜升平、又逢元宵佳致。\n鳌山高耸翠。\n对端门、珠玑交制。\n似嫦娥降仙宫，乍临凡世。\n恩露匀施，凭御栏、圣颜垂视。\n撒金钱，乱抛坠。\n万姓推抢没理会。\n告官里。\n这失仪、且与免罪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60228,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"袁祹","text":"金瓶芍药三千朵，玉轴琵琶四百弦。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60229,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"三高祠","author":"袁聘儒","text":"功成但可将身去，逃难安贫适所遭。\n三子有灵应共笑，一时何意故为高。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60230,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题曹娥庙","author":"袁豢龙","text":"不是沉渊效楚平，爱亲念重爱身轻。\n一抔残土今如昨，千载英魂死亦生。\n辞诧外孙堪称德，书传列女永扬名。\n哀哀衔痛无时极，犹听江猿似哭声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60231,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"卜居","author":"袁瑨","text":"宦海茫茫阔，幽栖洵远图。\n折腰原为米，搔首却思鲈。\n笳鼓深秋动，田园旧梦无。\n干戈方满地，吾辈尚穷途。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60232,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游白云山","author":"袁瑨","text":"策杖白云岑，云深不知处。\n恍见云中君，白云乡里住。\n举手弄行云，招我登云路。\n漫漫云路长，愿乘黄鹤驭。\n黄鹤不复回，白云自来去。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60233,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"水仙王庙辞","author":"袁韶","text":"桂水阔兮仙宫，今何为兮山之中。\n羌时俗兮改错，寄嘉名兮土龙。\n卜中洲兮芷闾，仙归兮故居。\n旂夫容兮兰枻，诏冯夷兮先驱。\n杜蘅纷兮旅庭，酌寒泉兮秋英。\n福帝郊兮尘清，终万古兮扬灵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60234,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题林和靖像","author":"袁韶","text":"避影林壑，清畏人知。\n尔梅多事，漏吾天机。\n长风孤骞，秋鹤与飞。\n山高水深，无成无亏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60235,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"袁韶","text":"宴堂联族子，讲席后诸生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60236,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游澹岩偶得二绝 其一","author":"袁镇","text":"谁道灵仙擘不开，天然琼室与瑶台。\n涪翁句重曾相识，料想烟霞许我来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60237,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游澹岩偶得二绝 其二","author":"袁镇","text":"石门定与玉京连，曾著方壶不老仙。\n犹有当年丹灶在，空岩寂寂锁寒烟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60238,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又二首 其二","author":"袁燮","text":"平生酷爱水浮天，每到东湖意豁然。\n要识此湖功利溥，旱时无限荫民田。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60239,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又二首 其一","author":"袁燮","text":"重峦叠嶂巧萦纡，中有汪汪万顷湖。\n山色水光相映发，清辉含处妙难摹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60240,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"与韩抚干大伦八首 其八","author":"袁燮","text":"作诗真欲挽君留，蜀道平宁倚运筹。\n他日功名成遂后，犹能枉顾絜翁不。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60241,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"与韩抚干大伦八首 其七","author":"袁燮","text":"年几五十无知己，乘兴将为剑阁行。\n从此与君尤隔绝，兴怀畴昔若为情。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60242,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"与韩抚干大伦八首 其六","author":"袁燮","text":"思君风度心如结，何日从容迭献酬。\n凉入郊墟能过我，奉陪童育两山游。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60243,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"与韩抚干大伦八首 其五","author":"袁燮","text":"剧谈时事言皆验，筹略知非小丈夫。\n独恨人微言不效，未能推挽上亨衢。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60244,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"与韩抚干大伦八首 其四","author":"袁燮","text":"几年惯踏软红尘，终日眉攒气不伸。\n每到山斋闻好语，令人胸臆便生春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60245,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"与韩抚干大伦八首 其三","author":"袁燮","text":"等閒援笔赋新篇，句法新奇思涌泉。\n绝胜唐人作诗苦，推敲一字强雕镌。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60246,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"与韩抚干大伦八首 其二","author":"袁燮","text":"肯随流俗慕纷华，闭户观书遍五车。\n器业要为当世用，直须渟蓄渺无涯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60247,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"与韩抚干大伦八首 其一","author":"袁燮","text":"故国由来重世臣，芬芳累叶镇如新。\n中兴第一功臣裔，卓荦如君信有人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60248,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"久不见竹堂高篇辄以湘窣索之两诗继至因用其韵 其二","author":"袁燮","text":"往时剩喜亲标格，今日无因款话言。\n兀坐书斋饱蔬食，想公饮客厌熊蹯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60249,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"久不见竹堂高篇辄以湘窣索之两诗继至因用其韵 其一","author":"袁燮","text":"壶中老子兴不浅，丰颊樽前胜玉梅。\n肯为莼羹下犀箸，聊凭催促好诗来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60250,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"小松二首 其二","author":"袁燮","text":"初栽准拟雨如膏，无奈晴暄思郁陶。\n造物见怜甘泽霈，倚天会见百寻高。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60251,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"小松二首 其一","author":"袁燮","text":"琐琐新松杂稚杉，青青数寸倚崭岩。\n牛冈自有神呵护，未怕林间走鹿馋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60252,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山中","author":"袁燮","text":"古松奇石水潺潺，小小茅庵一两间。\n野性自知难适俗，山林僻处且偷閒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60253,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山月","author":"袁燮","text":"好风吹雨到山前，月与山翁故有缘。\n静夜相看两寥寂，水流岩下泻潺潺。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60254,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山居二首 其二","author":"袁燮","text":"城居未免嚣尘役，野处閒观德性初。\n究竟孰为清与浊，此心安处即吾庐。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60255,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山居二首 其一","author":"袁燮","text":"舍北巑岏万叠青，门前列岫巧相迎。\n天公有意怜寒士，锡与公侯百雉城。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60256,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"书先茔二首 其二","author":"袁燮","text":"杖藜数数款松关，岂为多情酷爱山。\n痛念慈颜隔泉壤，此心那得片时閒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60257,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"书先茔二首 其一","author":"袁燮","text":"我卜山冈亩百金，家贫自叹力难任。\n杉松尽是亲栽植，寄与樵人念此心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60258,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"天童道上二首 其二","author":"袁燮","text":"太白峰前三十里，古松夹道奏竽笙。\n清辉秀色交相映，未羡山阴道上行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60259,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}}]